      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AT THE DISTANCE (2) recorded a strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 1690m at Kilmore. Has the benefit of a good draw. Good enough to put himself in the winners' stall. NEDZA THRILLER (10) settled in the leading division then drove to the lead and kept finding to score a deserved win in a 1690m race at this track last start, arriving 3 metres ahead of his rivals. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. That latest effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. CONNIES PRESIDENT NZ (11) is also high on the list of contenders despite a tough draw. Best form measures up favourably in this line-up so just needs a bit of luck to go his way. SNICKERS EXPRESS (9) is in the mix after turning in a better effort last start to finish third at Terang over 2180m.",
